tm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.890" end="52.822">看穿人心谁能</span><span begin="52.822" end="53.142">比</span></p><p begin="53.689" end="54.949" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.689" end="54.595">你算计我算计</span><span begin="54.595" end="54.949">你</span></p><p begin="55.554" end="56.822" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.554" end="56.423">阴暗的卡卡头</span><span begin="56.423" end="56.822">挤</span></p><p begin="57.351" end="58.615" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.351" end="58.229">天塌了脑壳去</span><span begin="58.229" end="58.615">顶</span></p><p begin="58.615" end="1:00.831" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.615" end="59.129">那些</span><span begin="59.129" end="59.362">走</span><span begin="59.362" end="59.576">过的</span><span begin="59.576" end="1:00.031">路</span> <span begin="1:00.031" end="1:00.310">趟过</span><span begin="1:00.310" end="1:00.467">的</span><span begin="1:00.467" end="1:00.831">河</span></p><p begin="1:00.851" end="1:02.614" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.851" end="1:01.785">为了身外物人</span><span begin="1:01.785" end="1:02.250">变成了</span><span begin="1:02.250" end="1:02.614">魔</span></p><p begin="1:02.717" end="1:04.404" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.717" end="1:03.012">读过</span><span begin="1:03.012" end="1:03.161">的</span><span begin="1:03.161" end="1:03.622">书</span> <span begin="1:03.622" end="1:03.973">啃过的</span><span begin="1:03.973" end="1:04.404">馍</span></p><p begin="1:04.432" end="1:06.186" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.432" end="1:05.383">求神拜佛不如</span><span begin="1:05.383" end="1:05.831">知足常</span><span begin="1:05.831" end="1:06.186">乐</span></p><p begin="1:06.312" end="1:07.968" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.312" end="1:07.224">感谢我妈老汉</span><span begin="1:07.224" end="1:07.604">给我的</span><span begin="1:07.604" end="1:07.968">命</span></p><p begin="1:07.988" end="1:09.773" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.988" e